    "# Exploratory Data Analysis — Credit Card Fraud Detection\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook explores the transaction dataset to validate its structural integrity, quantify class imbalance, and examine feature distributions relevant to fraud detection. Findings from this analysis directly inform the preprocessing and modeling decisions in the notebooks that follow."
   ]
  },
