   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Target Distribution\n",
    "\n",
    "Class imbalance is examined using both raw counts and percentages, visualized on a log scale to make the minority class visible alongside the majority class.\n",
    "\n",
    "- The target variable is binary:\n",
    "    - 1 -> indicates a fraudulent transaction\n",
    "    - 0 -> indicates a legitimate transaction\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 26,
   "id": "1f8b4058-74cd-4397-9a27-9be9cf7a55a4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
