    "### Correlation Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Pairwise correlations across all numeric features are examined to confirm PCA feature orthogonality and to check for any unexpected structural relationships."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "ef26eea0-dbf0-4984-8339-520b1eab8444",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
